{"text":"ABSTRACT","rect":[118.8365,433.6066,161.9519,441.0778],"fontSize":7.4712},
{"text":"Evaluation of coronary artery disease (CAD) using coronary computed tomography angiography (CCTA) has seen a","rect":[118.6635,407.3758,501.7981,414.847],"fontSize":7.4712},
{"text":"paradigm shift in the last decade. Evidence increasingly supports the clinical utility of CCTA across various stages of CAD,","rect":[118.6635,395.4624,517.4423,402.9336],"fontSize":7.4712},
{"text":"from the detection of early subclinical disease to the assessment of acute chest pain. Additionally, CCTA can be used to","rect":[118.6635,383.5489,517.3942,391.0201],"fontSize":7.4712},
{"text":"noninvasively quantify plaque burden and identify high-risk plaque, aiding in diagnosis, prognosis, and treatment. This is","rect":[118.6635,371.5585,517.4423,379.0297],"fontSize":7.4712},
{"text":"especially important in the evaluation of CAD in immune-driven conditions with increased cardiovascular disease prev-","rect":[118.6635,359.6451,516.3269,367.1162],"fontSize":7.4712},
{"text":"alence. Emerging applications of CCTA based on hemodynamic indices and plaque characterization may provide","rect":[118.6635,347.6451,492.7115,355.1162],"fontSize":7.4712},
{"text":"personalized risk assessment, affect disease detection, and further guide therapy. This review provides an update on the","rect":[118.6635,335.7316,517.3942,343.2028],"fontSize":7.4712},
{"text":"evidence, clinical applications, and emerging technologies surrounding CCTA as highlighted at the 2019 National Heart,","rect":[118.6635,323.7412,517.4615,331.2124],"fontSize":7.4712},
{"text":"Lung and Blood Institute CCTA Summit. (J Am Coll Cardiol 2020;76:1226","rect":[118.6635,311.7508,366.1154,319.222],"fontSize":7.4712},
